-- Migration 0134: Expand Bangladesh Tuition & Residential Location Catalog (Phase 4)
-- Adds 200 vetted, high-demand residential, university, college, and tuition locations across Bangladesh:
-- - 118 sub-areas across existing supported cities/districts:
--   * Dhaka (48 locations: Senpara Parbata, Agargaon Taltola/BNP Bazar, Shantiniketan Tejgaon, Monipur High School zones, Iqbal Road, Asad Avenue, Dhanmondi Road 4/8, Baridhara J Block, Bashundhara Blocks A/B/H/J/K/L, 100 Feet Road, UIU & Brac Univ campuses, Banasree Blocks A-G, Laxmibazar, Jagannath Univ, Swamibagh, Gopibagh, etc.)
--   * Chattogram (15 locations: CMC Campus, Chittagong College & Mohsin College areas, Ispahani Mor, Polytechnic, Foys Lake, Halishahar Rampur, North/South Kattali, Rahattarpool, Dr Khastagir & St Scholastica school areas, etc.)
--   * Regional hubs (55 locations across Sylhet, Rajshahi, Khulna, Barishal, Mymensingh, Rangpur, Cumilla, Gazipur, Narayanganj, Tangail, Sirajganj, Bogura, Jashore, Kushtia)
-- - 8 new major education cities + 74 sub-areas (82 items):
--   * Feni (city + 10 areas: Grand Trunk Road, Masterpara, Academy Road, Feni Govt College, Cadet College, etc.)
--   * Dinajpur (city + 10 areas: Balubari, Ghashipara, Nimtola, HSTU Campus, Dinajpur Medical College, etc.)
--   * Pabna (city + 10 areas: Govt Edward College, Shalgaria, Radhanagar, PUST Campus, Pabna Medical College, etc.)
--   * Faridpur (city + 10 areas: Jhiltuli, Goalchamot, Alipur, Govt Rajendra College branches, BSMMC, etc.)
--   * Brahmanbaria (city + 9 areas: Medda, Moulovipara, Paikpara, Govt College, Annada Govt High School, etc.)
--   * Narsingdi (city + 8 areas: Satirpara, Brahminpara, Velanagar, Madhabdi, Govt College, etc.)
--   * Noakhali (city + 8 areas: Maijdee Court, Town Hall Mor, Housing Estate, NSTU Campus, Govt College, etc.)
--   * Cox's Bazar (city + 8 areas: Kolatoli, Jhawtola, Boro Bazar, Govt College, Link Road, etc.)
-- Idempotent upsert ensures safe execution in existing environments.

ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE
  `label` = VALUES(`label`),
  `type` = VALUES(`type`),
  `country` = VALUES(`country`),
  `parentId` = VALUES(`parentId`),
  `enabled` = VALUES(`enabled`),
  `origin` = VALUES(`origin`);
